{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nPlanning currently mixes snapshot reads, binding decisions, mode limits, and later handler assumptions. Retry recovery cannot be stable until all decisions derive from one frozen observation.\n\n## Outcome\nDefine immutable `Observation` and `TicketPlan` values and a pure planner that preserves the existing `Mutation` vocabulary/serialization. This task covers deterministic value construction only, not lifecycle dependency logic or preview output.\n\n## Plan\n1. Add frozen provider-neutral observation/version and per-ticket plan types with open payloads.\n2. Build pure planner inputs from local snapshot, remote snapshot, binding read view, mode, selection/filter, and limits.\n3. Refactor existing differ decisions into plan mutation values without filesystem, provider, subprocess, or clock I/O.\n4. Preserve existing mutation serialization and canonical hashes exactly.\n\n## Testing\nFeed frozen fixtures twice and compare immutable plans, hashes, diagnostics, and version identity. Poison all I/O seams.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Identical frozen inputs produce equal immutable observations and ticket plans.\n- [x] Plans carry existing mutations, diagnostics, disposition, and observation/version identity.\n- [x] Existing mutation serialization and canonical hashes remain byte-identical.\n- [x] Planner construction performs zero repository saves, ticket writes, Jira calls, subprocess launches, or ambient clock reads.\n- [x] Provider-specific payload extensions remain open without weakening the provider-neutral core fields.\n\n## Out of scope\nLifecycle intents, inter-ticket dependencies, caps ordering, preview rendering, and shadow cutover."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787603349559159001,"uuid":"0debedbc-27cb-4e31-9025-39166bfff3ae"}